[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" format=3]
; The ironwork of the things the pilgrim works (a lever's housing and handle, a door's lock band, an item's cradle): the
; biome's metal darkened, its edges trimmed pale so the shape reads against any wall, worn like the machines that made it.

